# Optional extra PDC seed nodes. Copy to <data-dir>/seed_nodes.txt (next to p2pstate.bin).
# One host:port per line; host may be an IPv4 address or a DNS name. Up to 16 entries.
# Lines that start with '#' and blank lines are ignored. The node only uses these to find peers.
#
# seed1.example.org:19121
# 203.0.113.7:19121
